WEBVTT

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:18.470
<i>Who will perform first at the entry concert?</i>

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:22.890
<i>Shining glamorous and 
sexy on this dark night,</i>

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:25.330
<i>four jewels glittering with individuality.</i>

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:28.900
<i>Yes, it's QUARTET NIGHT!</i>

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:11.680
Amazing...

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:14.140
They've powered up so much.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:17.860
The arrangement is nothing 
like the demo we heard.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:19.650
The lyrics are different, too.

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:21.570
Evolution?

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:25.600
To evolve means grow.

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:26.530
Grow...

00:04:27.210 --> 00:04:30.120
Not revolution, but evolution?

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:33.120
Not change, but growth.

00:04:33.390 --> 00:04:38.590
In other words, they're declaring war on us.

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:41.300
So they're looking for a real fight.

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:45.840
The normally cool upperclassmen 
are so passionate.

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:49.050
Were they inspired by STARISH's song?

00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:54.770
Yeah. They're showing them how they've 
grown to reach even greater heights.

00:04:56.980 --> 00:05:01.150
Well done, QUARTET NIGHT.

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:06.200
An evolution to challenge revolution.

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:09.490
A growth to rival change.

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:12.830
This is their answer.

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:15.160
This is exactly what I wanted.

00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:18.080
No, no.

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:22.960
QUARTET NIGHT's best effort 
is even greater than that.

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:33.520
Wow! They really are amazing.

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:36.730
They've seen the blessings of the Muses.

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:38.280
It's an honor.

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:40.480
Yes. It has me shaking.

00:05:40.710 --> 00:05:45.940
Those incredible men 
called us their equals and rivals.

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:48.840
We'd better answer them in kind.

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:53.200
Yeah! Let's start a revolution 
even greater than their evolution.

00:05:54.210 --> 00:05:55.650
I'm so excited.

00:05:55.650 --> 00:05:57.610
I can't wait for our turn.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:09.540
QUARTET NIGHT! QUARTET NIGHT! QUARTET NIGHT!

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:02.920
<i>QUARTET NIGHT!</i>

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:06.260
<i>Everyone in the audience 
is chanting the same thing.</i>

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:09.550
<i>Such intensity and passion 
from the very first song.</i>

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:13.430
<i>But the entry concert 
is just getting started.</i>

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:29.820
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:34.760
<i>That was a wonderful performance.</i>

00:06:40.510 --> 00:06:42.920
I've never felt anything like this.

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:47.630
I had no idea I had such 
passionate emotions inside me.

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:50.800
We've done everything we needed to do.

00:06:51.570 --> 00:06:54.300
Yeah. I've got no regrets.

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:56.460
Say what, Ran-Ran?

00:06:56.460 --> 00:06:58.860
Those sound like last words to me.

00:06:58.860 --> 00:07:00.740
Just for today.

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:04.310
I agree. I have no regrets 
on this day, either.

00:07:04.310 --> 00:07:05.020
However...

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:10.990
Today isn't the end, but the beginning 
of the path we're going to take.

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:12.780
Yeah.

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:16.740
We'll become the opening artist 
and make our international debut.

00:07:17.430 --> 00:07:19.710
And the world will kneel before us.

00:07:19.950 --> 00:07:23.670
Singing as four doesn't sound too bad, either.

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:35.720
Rivals recognize each other's talent 
and try to surpass the other.

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:43.150
They change and evolve, 
seeking to reach the constellations in the sky!

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:48.430
This is the revolution that will 
take them to the world stage!

00:07:48.430 --> 00:07:53.970
And this revolution isn't over yet!

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:12.970
QUARTET NIGHT's song 
is still ringing in my ears.

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:16.040
Do you think STARISH entered?

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:18.350
I really hope they perform.

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:27.670
They're representing different genres, 
but everyone's so passionate.

00:08:27.670 --> 00:08:31.670
The Triple S opening ceremony will be 
simultaneously broadcast across the world.

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:35.360
No major artist can afford 
to miss this opportunity.

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:39.120
That's why they burn with passion.

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:43.840
So far, QUARTET NIGHT is leading the pack.

00:08:43.840 --> 00:08:45.570
I agree.

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:48.200
It'll come down to whether 
or not STARISH appears.

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:49.040
Yes.

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:55.590
<i>Such passion. Such excitement.</i>

00:08:55.590 --> 00:09:03.060
<i>All eyes are focused on the Triple S 
entry concert as it enters its final phase.</i>

00:09:09.260 --> 00:09:13.820
No matter how amazing the other 
performers are, we'll be okay.

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:18.330
Yeah. We'll become 
the Triple S opening artist.

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:21.910
That's what we've been working towards.

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:26.460
STARISH, we're ready for you.

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:48.520
You must have seen it.

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:50.440
Our best effort.

00:09:50.950 --> 00:09:53.190
Yes, we saw it.

00:09:53.470 --> 00:09:58.160
We surpassed your revolution and evolved.

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:05.620
Because you rose to our level, 
as promised, we climbed even higher.

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:09.630
Then we'll go even higher than that.

00:10:09.930 --> 00:10:13.300
We'll incite a revolution 
that will surpass your evolution.

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:15.000
We'll show you!

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:26.850
I look forward to it.

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:47.910
<i>It's time for the final group.</i>

00:10:48.570 --> 00:10:51.440
The time has come.

00:10:52.250 --> 00:11:00.560
How will STARISH respond 
to QUARTET NIGHT's evolution?

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:03.930
Come on and show me!

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:07.890
Show me!

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:24.530
Guys.

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:32.120
Do you remember what you 
said at our first concert?

00:11:34.220 --> 00:11:36.210
"Music changes the world."

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:40.470
Changing the world 
means starting a revolution.

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:46.050
Come to think of it, we may have been 
working towards a revolution since then.

00:11:46.410 --> 00:11:48.890
We've always been aiming for a revolution.

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:53.810
Haruka, we're off to change 
the world with music.

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:57.570
Yeah. We're going to set the crowd on fire!

00:11:58.890 --> 00:12:03.950
We're sending the world 
your song and our voices.

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:13.080
Let's go.

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:16.500
The entrance to the world lies ahead.

00:12:16.730 --> 00:12:18.660
Yeah, let's go.

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:20.340
We'll do our best.

00:12:21.690 --> 00:12:25.050
STARISH, fight!

00:12:28.570 --> 00:12:30.730
<i>It's finally time.</i>

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:35.240
<i>The last ones to perform are</i>

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:41.230
<i>a group that made its way 
through the hardships</i>

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:44.450
<i>of the entry race with their 
passionate friendship.</i>

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:48.680
<i>It's time for these seven stars to shine!</i>

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:51.290
<i>STARISH!</i>

00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:56.270
<i>With a perpetually sunny heart, 
he'll go anywhere with you!</i>

00:12:56.270 --> 00:13:02.330
<i>Flashing you an energetic 
peace sign is Ittoki Otoya!</i>

00:13:03.620 --> 00:13:05.990
<i>He keeps his overflowing emotions 
locked away in his heart!</i>

00:13:05.990 --> 00:13:11.520
<i>It's the courteous and 
sincere Hijirikawa Masato!</i>

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:15.880
<i>He'll envelop you with kindness like the sun!</i>

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:19.630
<i>He'll watch over you with strength 
like Sirius in the night sky!</i>

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:22.850
<i>It's Shinomiya Natsuki!</i>

00:13:24.270 --> 00:13:26.610
<i>His emotions lie hidden behind a cool face!</i>

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:33.040
<i>Descending from the sky is Ichinose Tokiya!</i>

00:13:35.480 --> 00:13:38.400
<i>Killer winks and blown kisses!</i>

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:41.440
<i>Passion burns like a flame in his heart!</i>

00:13:41.440 --> 00:13:45.300
<i>It's Jinguji Ren!</i>

00:13:45.900 --> 00:13:48.650
<i>He burns with the flames of masculinity!</i>

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:51.650
<i>He will protect you, no matter what comes!</i>

00:13:51.650 --> 00:13:54.250
<i>It's Kurusu Syo!</i>

00:13:56.980 --> 00:14:02.520
<i>Putting the love of the Muses into song, 
he's pure and hardworking!</i>

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:05.690
<i>It's Aijima Cecil!</i>

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:23.550
<i>It is the light in the darkness.</i>

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:27.160
<i>It makes flowers bloom in wastelands.</i>

00:14:29.560 --> 00:14:33.220
<i>It sends hearts flying into the sky.</i>

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:37.230
<i>Music changes the world.</i>

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:49.570
Five!

00:14:49.850 --> 00:14:50.530
Four!

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:51.490
Three!

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:52.450
Two!

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:53.410
One!

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:57.280
STARISH! STARISH! STARISH!

00:16:57.280 --> 00:17:24.270
STARISH! STARISH! STARISH!

00:16:57.770 --> 00:16:59.240
Not bad.

00:16:59.890 --> 00:17:01.450
I've been waiting for this.

00:17:02.060 --> 00:17:03.540
It gives me chills.

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:07.670
An objective analysis reveals we're equal.

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:13.060
And we're clearly far ahead 
of the rest of the competitors.

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:19.340
Wait a minute.

00:17:19.340 --> 00:17:21.630
They're totally equal.

00:17:21.630 --> 00:17:24.020
But what do the judges think?

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:27.980
Haruka, you're incredible.

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:33.210
<i>This concludes all the performances.</i>

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:34.990
<i>One of them...</i>

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:41.660
Yes! I feel amazing.

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:49.540
Long time, no see.

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:55.520
Our ultra super, miraculous 
group has returned.

00:17:57.020 --> 00:17:58.110
We're back.

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:04.530
HEAVENS?

00:18:04.960 --> 00:18:05.950
But why?

00:18:10.450 --> 00:18:11.860
<i>HEAVENS!</i>

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:15.110
<i>The group that went missing 
after their defeat to STARISH</i>

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:20.910
<i>at the Uta Pri awards has suddenly returned.</i>

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:38.510
Seven?

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:45.640
That's...

00:20:33.410 --> 00:20:34.710
HEAVENS.

00:20:35.320 --> 00:20:36.390
Those guys...

00:20:36.980 --> 00:20:38.420
I didn't think they'd return.

00:20:38.860 --> 00:20:41.380
They're far better than before.

00:20:46.650 --> 00:20:48.850
Summoned by the sweet voices of angels,

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:56.060
the idol descended from heaven, 
Otori Eiichi, has returned.

00:20:59.490 --> 00:21:02.220
I am Sumeragi Kira.

00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:05.990
I missed you.

00:21:09.820 --> 00:21:12.970
I'm Mikado Nagi, cutest idol in the universe.

00:21:12.970 --> 00:21:15.460
All your eyes belong on me.

00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:16.670
Got it?

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:20.580
Um...

00:21:22.490 --> 00:21:24.810
I'm Otori Eiji.

00:21:26.170 --> 00:21:27.250
Nice to meet you.

00:21:31.610 --> 00:21:32.870
Nice to meet you.

00:21:32.870 --> 00:21:34.640
I'm Kiryuin Van.

00:21:35.280 --> 00:21:37.370
We will conquer the world.

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:39.500
Just kidding.

00:21:42.490 --> 00:21:45.070
I'm Hyuga Yamato, 
HEAVENS' strongest member.

00:21:46.390 --> 00:21:48.520
If you've got a problem, come and get me.

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:55.000
The stars have led me to you.

00:21:55.770 --> 00:21:59.040
Now speak my name.

00:21:59.040 --> 00:22:01.210
Amakusa Shion.

00:22:11.680 --> 00:22:13.110
STARISH?

00:22:17.210 --> 00:22:19.020
QUARTET NIGHT?

00:22:21.780 --> 00:22:26.340
No. No, no, no!

00:22:26.810 --> 00:22:30.210
The world will be ruled by HEAVENS!

00:22:34.550 --> 00:23:24.380
HEAVENS! HEAVENS! HEAVENS!

00:22:37.750 --> 00:23:24.380
STARISH! STARISH! STARISH!

00:22:39.620 --> 00:23:24.380
QUARTET NIGHT! QUARTET NIGHT! QUARTET NIGHT!

00:22:43.060 --> 00:22:44.830
Nice, nice.

00:22:44.830 --> 00:22:47.130
This is an incredibly interesting development.

00:22:47.830 --> 00:22:53.060
But QUARTET NIGHT will be the opening artist.

00:22:57.810 --> 00:22:58.660
You're wrong.

00:22:59.270 --> 00:23:02.020
The opening artist will be STARISH.

00:23:02.600 --> 00:23:04.100
We're confident.

00:23:04.520 --> 00:23:07.990
We've worked hard to make our dream come true.

00:23:24.380 --> 00:23:27.150
Revolution!

00:23:28.010 --> 00:23:36.430
My revolution is now perfect!

00:23:36.430 --> 00:23:44.120
The gears of destiny 
are now grinding into motion.

00:24:06.650 --> 00:24:07.570
STARISH.

00:24:07.570 --> 00:24:08.810
And QUARTET NIGHT.

00:24:08.810 --> 00:24:09.770
And HEAVENS.

00:24:09.770 --> 00:24:11.220
Uta Pri!
